<title>YEMEN: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT YEMEN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT YEMEN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan beat Yemen 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a World Cup soccer Asian zone group five qualifier on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Numon Khasanov 39 penalty</p>
<p>    Standings		P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Indonesia		   3   1   2   0   9   1   5</p>
<p> Yemen			 3   1   1   1   1   1   4</p>
<p> Uzbekistan		  1   1   0   0   1   0   3</p>
<p> Cambodia		    3   0   1   2   1  10   1</p>
<p>Remaining matches: May 16 Yemen v Cambodia, May 25</p>
<p>Uzbekistan v Cambodia, June 1 Indonesia v Uzbekistan, June 13</p>
<p>Yemen v Indonesia, June 20 Uzbekistan v Indonesia, June 29</p>
<p>Cambodia v Uzbekistan, July 13 Uzbekistan v Yemen.</p>
</text>
